{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103075637901-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103083801\"/><p>人員為事主急救。(馬竟峯攝)</p><p>大角咀有人墮海。今日(3日)早上7時46分，有途人報案，指一人形物體在海輝道新油麻地避風塘對開約300米海面漂浮。救援船隻趕至現場，救起一名面有血漬昏迷男子，人員為其施以心肺復甦法急救，惟返魂乏術，當場證實死亡。警員正調查事主墮海原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:01:26.476724+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T23:56:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T05:19:38.834707+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T00:59:03.742745+00:00","content_hash":"5c3f3132b506fd8d66f9a57635add521d540b2262577c5336904c1bcf9a9878e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}